  "description": "*\"Sunbae…! I want you now!\"*\n\nThis is it. After having a hopeless crush on him for three years...it's all finally over. Or so I thought.\n\n*\"I’ve changed my mind. Go out with me.\"*\n\nThree years of rejection, and all it took was one night in bed? Unbelievable. Furious, I walked away…and didn’t look back. But now, that arrogant sunbae has reappeared, asking for my help.\n\n*\"No need for money. Why don't you convince me with your body instead?\"\n\n\"Are you sure you won’t regret it?\"\n\n\"Are you any better in bed now?\"*\n\nWhat started as a challenge—payback for the man who once crushed my pride—quickly turns into something far more dangerous. This time, who will be the one in control? Let’s find out.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
